    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Related game</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/4c552f0ecd579cd68ba791832915e07f.avif?t=1753350161\" width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Long has incense ceased to rise; the gods lie cold, unseen,<br>A trace endures\u2014a whisper faint\u2014where hallowed halls convene.<br>These ancient gods bear no mercy\u2019s grace; all life to them is base,<br>As lowly ants beneath their gaze, in a heedless, empty land.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The living toil in ritual grim, to cast off flesh-bound chains,<br>To shed the brittle, frail confines of earthly form and pains.<br>Yet all the world sinks, madness-bound, where chaos roams unchained,<br>And life itself lies captive here, by broken minds restrained.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst low, endless chants beneath the Pantheon\u2019s throne, you open your stone eyes. With that awakening, a fierce urge stirs within\u2014to set heretic cults aright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Eastern Sacrifice</i>, ascend to godhood, restore humanity's honor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish a religion that reveres you, rise and reclaim!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the grand hall, you lower your gaze upon the fearful crowd, casting your first commanding sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/38efe7dddacd276a0698067768183c19.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominion Over Mortals in S\u00e9ance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will begin the game as the Fallen One. Command fanatics to build shelters upon the ancient ruins, restoring prosperity. Send disciples to explore untamed lands, vanquishing demons along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the cost of ascension to godhood is immense, each new tier unlocked grants you a new theurgy, amplifying the power of your every click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/a4603fa9f2594e8b505058716450402a.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox Building in Idle Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Industrial and Functional Buildings: A sandbox-style home-building system. Transform the deserted, forgotten mountain sect into a sprawling \u00a0sanctuary of immense power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ Production Systems: Unlock policies and technologies to enable automated management of fanatics and production lines. Gain rewards through incremental management\u2014easily idle and continue collecting resources even offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/02aef9b11d12094d9814f6dbbd997028.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Combat, and Divine Intervene</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new features and theurgies to enlighten your disciples, transforming these mere mortals into powerful vindicators! As they venture forth to expand your domain, you\u2019ll easily oversee every aspect of growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When disciples encounter the fiercest foes, step in with divine intervention and possession\u2014vanquish the enemy with your own hand. And remember\u2014make use of theurgy and your finely-honed clicking prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/e2ce02233d0bd2bac9978c7eda136bac.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/ac67733f0032e30b6ab40a5f89f78311.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sacrifice, Ascend, and Reincarnate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fiercely competitive post-apocalyptic world, the ascension rite grants you massive global boosts and, after reincarnation, a more prosperous world awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the rite demands a heavy toll: it welcomes human sacrifice and suffering without exception. This also draws the attention of the old gods, whose wrath will follow you into the next cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/4fec1421c333a5d655af1c1f9904dabe.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension rites are varied, please choose your principle and authority benefits wisely. But most importantly, it is the right sacrifices you must choose with utmost care\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/4c552f0ecd579cd68ba791832915e07f.avif?t=1753350161\" width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Long has incense ceased to rise; the gods lie cold, unseen,<br>A trace endures\u2014a whisper faint\u2014where hallowed halls convene.<br>These ancient gods bear no mercy\u2019s grace; all life to them is base,<br>As lowly ants beneath their gaze, in a heedless, empty land.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The living toil in ritual grim, to cast off flesh-bound chains,<br>To shed the brittle, frail confines of earthly form and pains.<br>Yet all the world sinks, madness-bound, where chaos roams unchained,<br>And life itself lies captive here, by broken minds restrained.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst low, endless chants beneath the Pantheon\u2019s throne, you open your stone eyes. With that awakening, a fierce urge stirs within\u2014to set heretic cults aright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Eastern Sacrifice</i>, ascend to godhood, restore humanity's honor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish a religion that reveres you, rise and reclaim!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the grand hall, you lower your gaze upon the fearful crowd, casting your first commanding sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/38efe7dddacd276a0698067768183c19.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominion Over Mortals in S\u00e9ance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will begin the game as the Fallen One. Command fanatics to build shelters upon the ancient ruins, restoring prosperity. Send disciples to explore untamed lands, vanquishing demons along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the cost of ascension to godhood is immense, each new tier unlocked grants you a new theurgy, amplifying the power of your every click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/a4603fa9f2594e8b505058716450402a.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox Building in Idle Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Industrial and Functional Buildings: A sandbox-style home-building system. Transform the deserted, forgotten mountain sect into a sprawling \u00a0sanctuary of immense power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ Production Systems: Unlock policies and technologies to enable automated management of fanatics and production lines. Gain rewards through incremental management\u2014easily idle and continue collecting resources even offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/02aef9b11d12094d9814f6dbbd997028.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Combat, and Divine Intervene</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new features and theurgies to enlighten your disciples, transforming these mere mortals into powerful vindicators! As they venture forth to expand your domain, you\u2019ll easily oversee every aspect of growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When disciples encounter the fiercest foes, step in with divine intervention and possession\u2014vanquish the enemy with your own hand. And remember\u2014make use of theurgy and your finely-honed clicking prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/e2ce02233d0bd2bac9978c7eda136bac.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/ac67733f0032e30b6ab40a5f89f78311.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sacrifice, Ascend, and Reincarnate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fiercely competitive post-apocalyptic world, the ascension rite grants you massive global boosts and, after reincarnation, a more prosperous world awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the rite demands a heavy toll: it welcomes human sacrifice and suffering without exception. This also draws the attention of the old gods, whose wrath will follow you into the next cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660330/extras/4fec1421c333a5d655af1c1f9904dabe.avif?t=1753350161\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension rites are varied, please choose your principle and authority benefits wisely. But most importantly, it is the right sacrifices you must choose with utmost care\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cThe Eastern Sacrifice\u201d is an idle game combining simulation with Eastern Cthulhu-inspired themes. In a world spiraling into chaos over authority, vanquish enemy, gather treasures, and build a devoted religion. Your sanctuary will help you reclaim theurgy, ascend to the divine realm.",
